OL,3,GNEWSAMan jailed after injuring off-duty
OL,4,Apolice officer during gun brawl
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been given a three-and-a-half
OL,7,Fyear sentence for injuring an off-duty
OL,8,Fpoliceman with a gun during an episode
OL,9,Fof cocaine-induced psychosis.
OL,11,F30-year-old Kyle Knell, of Tynan Drive
OL,12,Fin Newtownabbey, was sentenced on
OL,13,FFriday at Belfast Crown Court.
OL,15,FHe had pleaded guilty to a total of six
OL,16,Fcharges including two counts of
OL,17,Finflicting grievous bodily harm with
OL,18,Fintent, possessing a firearm in
OL,19,Fsuspicious circumstances and false
OL,20,Fimprisonment.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
